      "message": "Dave, thanks for the report. I’ve uploaded patchset 2, which fixes the make install-ext-deps failure you hit when upgrading from stable/2506. The cause was the clean target: $(I) now points to the real install path (/opt/vpp/external/x86_64), so clean tried to delete the previously installed system files. It now removes only the local copy ($(R)/$(I)). I also restored the DPDK build to use pkg-config and set PKG_CONFIG_SYSROOT_DIR so the .pc paths from the deb tmp dir resolve during linking. The vpp-ext-deps deb size is unchanged (76M). Could you re-run your stable/2506 → master make install-ext-deps sequence and confirm it’s fixed?",
